  "answer": "### Short Answer\nAn individual must file the annual income tax return on or before April 15 of the following year after the taxable year.\n\n### Interpretation\n\n### Practical Meaning\nTaxpayers should ensure that their income tax returns are prepared and submitted by this deadline to avoid penalties and interest on any unpaid taxes. It is advisable for individuals to keep accurate records of their income and deductions throughout the year to facilitate timely and accurate filing.",
